OL,3,GNEWSAReservoir surveys will mean years
OL,4,Aof 'road chaos'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA district councillor says he hears
OL,7,Fconcerns on a "daily basis" from locals
OL,8,Ffearing major disruption as survey work
OL,9,Ffor a new reservoir takes place.
OL,11,FCharlie Marks, of Fenland District
OL,12,FCouncil (FDC), predicts there will be
OL,13,Fseven to 10 years of "road chaos", with
OL,14,Fthousands of contractors flooding the
OL,15,Farea, if the planned Fens Reservoir
OL,16,Fnear Chatteris goes ahead.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
