OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAReservoir surveys will mean years
OL,4,Aof 'road chaos'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnglian Water and Cambridge Water are
OL,7,Fexpected to submit a joint application
OL,8,Fto the Planning Inspectorate in 2028,
OL,9,Fbefore a government decision in 2029,
OL,10,Fwith construction starting as early as
OL,11,F2030.
OL,13,FMarks said the area was saturated with
OL,14,Ftraffic and that heavy machinery would
OL,15,Fneed to use Fen roads that were already
OL,16,F"crumbling badly".
